sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Web as React/Vite
  participant Harness
  participant Rules as Domain rules
  participant Store as Repository
  User->>Web: Describe meal and options
  Web->>Harness: Structured task request
  Harness->>Rules: Validate profile and source fields
  Rules-->>Harness: safe / blocked / needs_confirmation
  Harness-->>Web: Bounded actions + rationale
  User->>Web: Confirm action or record
  Web->>Harness: Explicit write request
  Harness->>Store: Persist with operation key
  Store-->>Harness: Confirmed record
  Harness-->>Web: Feedback and recoverable state
